=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_f3a9 — Hana's Notebook-Only Desk; Tablet Stays at Bed (fork of p_b8c2)

Same two residents, same shift pattern. Hana uses her weekday mornings (06:30–13:30) for focused work or study at desk_b1, but she works with just her notebook and pen — not her tablet. The tablet_hana stays at nightstand_b1 all day (it is her reading device for bed, not a work tool). The 00:00 and daytime sightings confirm the tablet at nightstand_b1 (3 sightings, 0 at desk), while the notebook is at desk_b1 (3 sightings). The mug does not go to the desk; it stays in the cupboard or is at the kitchen table for breakfast.

What changed from the parent: (1) removed tablet_hana from desk_b1 entirely — it stays at nightstand_b1 00:00–24:00; (2) removed mug_hana from desk_b1 — it stays at cupboard_k1 except at kitchen_table_k1 for breakfast; (3) added pen_hana at desk_b1 during the work block; (4) revised claims to test the tablet at nightstand and the pen at desk. What would refute it: tablet_hana sighted at desk_b1 between 07:00 and 13:00 on a weekday; notebook_hana sighted at nightstand_b1 during the work block.

